#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-plugin.php:71
msgid ""
"OliForge CF7 Submission Guard requires Contact Form 7 to be installed and "
"active."
msgstr ""
"OliForge CF7 Submission Guard requiere que Contact Form 7 esté instalado y "
"activo."

